 "about_text": "YUKIKOMIZUTANI is a contemporary art gallery in Tokyo, founded in 2021 with the aim of bringing contemporary art from Tokyo to an international audience. The gallery is based inside TERRADA ART COMPLEX in Tennozu, an area where the Meguro River meets Tokyo Bay, home to the largest concentration of galleries in Japan. Through its exhibition program, YUKIKOMIZUTANI supports a diverse roster of artists working across painting, sculpture, textile and installation, and takes part in major art fairs in Japan and abroad. The gallery describes its mission as elevating the role of art in contemporary culture while helping develop Tennozu Isle into a significant arts and culture hub.",
